Changes made by the z authors (Apache-2.0 §4(b)):
- Every Radix / shadcn primitive is replaced by z's Base UI wrappers in
  apps/web/src/ui (Collapsible, Tooltip/IconButton, Button, Badge, Dialog,
  Autocomplete-based Command, PreviewCard for HoverCard, Select).
- @radix-ui/react-use-controllable-state is replaced by a local hook.
- Shimmer uses a CSS animation instead of `motion`; Carousel (embla) is a
  small local pager; Loader (no longer in the registry) is a local spinner.
- Streamdown plugins (@streamdown/code, /math, /mermaid) and Shiki are loaded
  lazily on first use.
- Strings come from z's i18n (en, vi); styling uses z's design tokens.
- Parts z does not use (attachments, branches, logos from models.dev, token
  cost via tokenlens) are left out.

Each adapted file carries a header naming its source and these changes.
